/* =========================================================================
   Playback Flow：涵蓋所有 S-Expression 組合子與全局移調指令
   - (layer ...) 平行疊加
   - (canon ...) 卡農自動錯位追逐
   - (loop ...) 循環重複
   - (seq ...) 序列串接
   - (play ...) 綁定抽象動機與樂器
   - (reverse ...) 逆行、(flip ...) 倒影、(transpose ...) 移調、(minor ...)/(major ...) 調式轉換、(vary ...) 多重變奏
   - {?+2} / {?-2} / {?=C} 播放期全局轉調
   ========================================================================= */

-> A
-> B
-> Rest
-> Waltz
-> (layer
(canon WeirdMotif (Violin Viola Cello) 1)
(loop WeirdPulse Marimba 2))
-> (canon WeirdStuff (Violin Viola Cello) 1)
-> (layer
(seq
(play (reverse WeirdMotif) Harpsichord)
(play (flip WeirdMotif) Flute)
(play (transpose WeirdMotif 5) Clarinet)
(play (minor (major WeirdMotif)) Oboe)
(play (vary WeirdMotif +7 reverse flip) Xylophone))
(loop WeirdPulse PizzicatoStrings 5)
(loop (transpose WeirdPulse -12) Bassoon 5))
-> {?+2}
-> A
-> {?-2}
-> B
-> {?=C}
-> C
-> {?+2}
-> C
-> D
-> M5
-> M7
-> M11
-> M13
-> Poly
-> Babel
->#

